        </caption>
     <thead>
        <tr>
          <th style="background-color: transparent; border-bottom: 1.0pt solid #000000; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 1.0pt solid #000000; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top; width: 467.91810000000003pt" colspan="3">
                        <p class="CellBody">This table shows common street tree types and their appropriateness within the transect zones. Title 18 of the <span class="italic">Engineering Standards</span> provides detailed specifications for landscaping within thoroughfares.</p>

          </th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th style="border-bottom: 1.0pt solid #000000; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 1.0pt solid #000000; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: middle; width: 192.7183pt">
