      <h3 class="Cite" id="10.60.10.090"><a name="10.60.10.090">10-60.10.090</a> Thoroughfare Assemblies</h3>
            <p class="P1">A.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;This section provides an example of thoroughfare assemblies that have been approved by the City for use in transect zones that are derived from the standards and specifications in Table 10-60.10-090.A., Thoroughfare Assemblies. The <span class="Emphasis">Engineering Standards</span> also provide additional detailed specifications for the design and construction of thoroughfares.</p>

            <p class="P1">&nbsp;</p>

